    "field": "Aerosol-cloud interactions",
    "problem": "The original study assessing errors from simplified cloud-borne aerosol treatments was flawed because an inadvertent deactivation of the first aerosol indirect effect led to a significant underestimation of the total indirect effect, necessitating a re-evaluation of the model results.",
    "method": "This paper corrects a previous study by repeating global aerosol model experiments with the first aerosol indirect effect turned on, which had been inadvertently disabled, to provide a more plausible estimate of the total indirect effect and re-evaluate the impact of different cloud-borne aerosol treatments.",
    "task": "The task is to correct a previous study's underestimated aerosol indirect effects by re-running global model simulations after an error was found where the first indirect effect had been inadvertently omitted.",
