    "innovation": "This corrigendum corrects an inadvertent error in a previous study, presenting a revised and more plausible estimate for the aerosol indirect effect (\u22120.7 W m\u207b\u00b2) while confirming the original conclusion regarding the relative errors of simplified cloud-borne aerosol treatments.",
